%% Medallion (Bronze → Silver → Gold) Lineage
flowchart TD
    A[Kafka: events.raw<br/>Avro / JSON] --> B{Schema OK?}
    B -- No --> Q[Quarantine Topic<br/>+ alerts]
    B -- Yes --> C[Bronze<br/>raw, immutable<br/>partitioned by dt]
    C --> D[Bot Tag<br/>+ heuristic score]
    D --> E[Silver<br/>bot-filtered<br/>deduped by event_id<br/>Z-ORDER user_id]
    E --> F[Sessionize<br/>30min inactivity]
    E --> G[Daily User Rollup]
    F --> H[Gold: session_metrics]
    G --> I[Gold: user_features_daily]
    H --> J[Dashboard / ML / Experiments]
    I --> J
